---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MCP" locale="tr" currentPath="/tr/docs/mcp">
  <PageHeader title="MCP (Model Bağlam Protokolü)" subtitle="AI ajanları için 160+ araçla tam MCP sunucusu" />

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4">Genel Bakış</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-6">
        Ajanlar CLI'yı tahmin etmek zorunda kalmamalı -- keyflip MCP konuşur. Tüm CLI yüzeyi 160+ MCP aracı olarak açığa çıkarılır, böylece bir ajan kabuk komutu olmadan her şeyi yapabilir.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Kurulum</h2>
      <CodeBlock code={`claude mcp add keyflip -- keyflip mcp
# veya tam kurulumu görün:
keyflip mcp --setup`} />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Araç Kategorileri</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Hesaplar</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_status</code>, <code>keyflip_list</code>, <code>keyflip_switch</code>, <code>keyflip_next</code>, <code>keyflip_add</code>, <code>keyflip_account_remove</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Sağlayıcılar</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_providers</code>, <code>keyflip_provider_use</code>, <code>keyflip_provider_add</code>, <code>keyflip_test_provider</code>, <code>keyflip_speedtest</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Filo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_fleet_status</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_push</code> (durumu yayınla + gelen kutusunu işle; sır ve uygulama izinleri ayrı), <code>keyflip_fleet_discover</code> (yerel ağdaki eşleri bul), <code>keyflip_fleet_switch</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_send_account</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_collect</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_keys</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_trust</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Thread'ler, zincirler &amp; ön kontrol</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_threads</code> (okuma: liste, zaman çizgisi, öneri, tersten id), <code>keyflip_thread_create|add|remove|drop|mirror</code>, <code>keyflip_sessions_attribute</code> (atanmamış oturumların hesabını geçiş günlüğünden tahmin et), <code>keyflip_chains</code> / <code>keyflip_chains_tighten</code>, <code>keyflip_switch_plan</code>, <code>keyflip_verify</code>, <code>keyflip_refresh</code> / <code>keyflip_refresh_schedule</code>, <code>keyflip_llm</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Geçmiş hijyeni</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_history_audit</code> (<code>alarm_count</code> ile <code>tolerated_count</code>'u ayırır), <code>keyflip_memory_audit</code>, <code>keyflip_history_scrub</code> (varsayılan plan, her yeniden yazımdan önce bundle), <code>keyflip_secrets_policy</code> (salt okunur) / <code>keyflip_secrets_tolerate</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Sohbetler</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_conv_list</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_search</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_context</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_show</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_status</code> (salt okunur, hiçbiri indeksi kendisi kurmaz), <code>keyflip_conv_index</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_export</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_index_schedule</code> (onay gerektirir)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Bağlam Katmanı</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_context_read</code>, <code>keyflip_context_task_set</code>, <code>keyflip_context_decision_add</code>, <code>keyflip_checkpoint_*</code></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Güvenlik Modeli</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li>Her aracın uygun JSON Şeması ve salt okunur/yıkıcı açıklamaları var</li>
        <li><strong>Değiştirici araçlar <code>confirm: true</code> gerektirir</strong> -- tanımlar ajanlara önce sormalarını söyler</li>
        <li>Şifreler asla MCP üzerinden kabul edilmez (örneğin sağlayıcı anahtarı ekleme CLI'da <code>--key-file</code>'a ertelenir)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Claude Code Becerisi</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-4">Dahili beceri, ajana keyflip'i ne zaman ve nasıl kullanacağını öğretir:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={`keyflip install-skill   # ~/.claude/skills/keyflip'e kopyalar`} />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
